          "description": "<p>When you perform an Accuracy Check, you may replace one of the Attribute dice with&nbsp;<br>Insight (such as 【INS + INS】 for a pistol or 【INS + MIG】 for a waraxe).</p>",
          "level": "1",
          "roll": "",
          "skill_name": "KNOWLEDGE IS POWER"
