        },
        "2": {
          "$deleted": false,
          "class": "NECROMANCER",
          "description": "<p>When another creature you can see loses Hit Points while in Crisis, if they are not&nbsp;<br>undead, you gain 1 Grave Point. You may never have more than 【SL + 1】 Grave Points.<br>When you are reduced to 0 Hit Points, you lose all Grave Points; then, if you lost at&nbsp;<br>least 1 Grave Point this way and this is the first time you are reduced to 0 HP during&nbsp;<br>this scene, you do not Surrender nor Sacrifice yourself: instead, you recover an amount&nbsp;<br>of HP equal to 【SL, multiplied by the amount of Grave Points you lost this way】.</p>",
          "level": "1",
          "roll": "",
          "skill_name": "BEYOND THE REALMS OF DEATH"
        },
        "3": {
          "$deleted": false,
          "class": "NECROMANCER",
          "description": "<p>After you cause one or more enemies to lose Hit Points, if you have acquired the&nbsp;<br>Beyond the Realms of Death Skill and at least one of them is suffering from shaken<br>and/or weak, you gain 1 Grave Point and recover 【SL &times; 2】 Hit Points and Mind Points.</p>",
          "level": "1",
          "roll": "",
          "skill_name": "FEAR IS THE KEY"
        },
        "4": {
          "$deleted": false,
          "class": "SHARPSHOOTER",
          "description": "<p>When you hit one or more targets with a ranged attack that would deal damage, you&nbsp;<br>may have the attack deal no damage. If you do, choose one option: inflict shaken on&nbsp;<br>each target hit by the attack; or inflict slow on each target hit by the attack; or each&nbsp;<br>target hit by the attack loses 【SL &times; 10】 Mind Points. Describe your maneuver!</p>",
          "level": "1",
          "roll": "",
          "skill_name": "WARNING SHOT"
        },
        "5": {
          "$deleted": false,
          "class": "SHARPSHOOTER",
          "description": "<p>You gain a bonus equal to 【SL】 to all Accuracy Checks with ranged weapons.</p>",
          "level": "1",
          "roll": "",
          "skill_name": "RANGED WEAPON MASTERY"
        },
        "6": {
          "$deleted": false,
          "class": "SHARPSHOOTER",
          "description": "<p>When you perform the Guard action, if you choose not to provide cover to another&nbsp;<br>creature, you may choose one option: the next ranged attack you perform before the&nbsp;<br>end of the current scene will deal 【SL &times; 2】 extra damage; or you may immediately&nbsp;<br>perform a free attack with a bow or firearm you have equipped, treating your High Roll&nbsp;<br>(HR) as 0 when calculating damage dealt by this attack.</p>",
          "level": "1",
          "roll": "",
          "skill_name": "HAWKEYE"
